---
import { ArrowUpRight, Mail, ClipboardList } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section id="contacto" class="contact-page">
	<div class="contact-page-inner">
		<p class="contact-intro">Elige el canal adecuado para tu consulta y comunícate directamente con nuestro equipo.</p>

		<div class="contact-admissions">
			<div class="contact-admissions-icon"><ClipboardList size={30} strokeWidth={1.7} /></div>
			<div class="contact-admissions-copy">
				<p class="contact-card-label">Admisiones</p>
				<h2>Comienza tu proceso de admisión</h2>
				<p>Completa el formulario oficial del colegio o escríbenos si necesitas orientación.</p>
				<a class="contact-email" href="mailto:admisiones@colegiosantagema.edu.ve">admisiones@colegiosantagema.edu.ve</a>
			</div>
			<a class="contact-form-link" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeCMifM5tZO5TDikC-exvSBLIL8ORDPxWRYouS-R9vXhYxX-w/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ir al formulario <ArrowUpRight size={18} /><span class="sr-only"> (abre en una pestaña nueva)</span></a>
		</div>

		<div class="contact-details" style="display:block">
			<div class="contact-details-heading"><p class="contact-eyebrow">Canales de atención</p><h2>Hablemos directamente.</h2><p>Elige el canal adecuado para tu consulta.</p></div>
			<div class="contact-card-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,28rem),1fr));gap:1.25rem;margin-top:2.5rem">
				<a class="contact-info-card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;min-height:16rem;padding:2rem;border:1px solid #d6e6f7;border-radius:1.6rem;background:#fff;color:#10243d;text-decoration:none" href="mailto:secretaria@colegiosantagema.edu.ve"><span class="contact-info-icon"><Mail size={28} strokeWidth={1.7} /></span><span class="contact-info-label" style="display:block">Consultas generales</span><strong style="display:block">Secretaría</strong><span class="contact-info-value" style="display:block">secretaria@colegiosantagema.edu.ve</span><ArrowUpRight class="contact-info-arrow" size={23} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
				<a class="contact-info-card contact-info-whatsapp" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;min-height:16rem;padding:2rem;border:1px solid #d6e6f7;border-radius:1.6rem;background:#fff;color:#10243d;text-decoration:none" href="https://wa.me/584242487238" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="contact-info-icon"><img src="/social/whatsapp.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></span><span class="contact-info-label" style="display:block">Respuesta directa</span><strong style="display:block">WhatsApp general</strong><span class="contact-info-value" style="display:block">+58 424 248 7238</span><ArrowUpRight class="contact-info-arrow" size={23} aria-hidden="true" /><span class="sr-only"> (abre WhatsApp en una pestaña nueva)</span></a>
				<a class="contact-info-card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;min-height:16rem;padding:2rem;border:1px solid #d6e6f7;border-radius:1.6rem;background:#fff;color:#10243d;text-decoration:none" href="mailto:administracion@colegiosantagema.edu.ve"><span class="contact-info-icon"><Mail size={28} strokeWidth={1.7} /></span><span class="contact-info-label" style="display:block">Trámites y pagos</span><strong style="display:block">Administración</strong><span class="contact-info-value" style="display:block">administracion@colegiosantagema.edu.ve</span><ArrowUpRight class="contact-info-arrow" size={23} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
				<a class="contact-info-card contact-info-whatsapp" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;min-height:16rem;padding:2rem;border:1px solid #d6e6f7;border-radius:1.6rem;background:#fff;color:#10243d;text-decoration:none" href="https://wa.me/584241834374" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="contact-info-icon"><img src="/social/whatsapp.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></span><span class="contact-info-label" style="display:block">Atención administrativa</span><strong style="display:block">WhatsApp administración</strong><span class="contact-info-value" style="display:block">+58 424 183 4374</span><ArrowUpRight class="contact-info-arrow" size={23} aria-hidden="true" /><span class="sr-only"> (abre WhatsApp en una pestaña nueva)</span></a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="contact-social">
			<div><p class="contact-eyebrow">Síguenos</p><h2>La vida del colegio, día a día.</h2></div>
			<div class="contact-social-links">
				<a href="https://www.instagram.com/santagemave/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/social/instagram.svg" width="22" height="22" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /> Instagram <ArrowUpRight size={16} /><span class="sr-only"> (abre en una pestaña nueva)</span></a>
				<a href="https://www.threads.com/@santagemave" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/social/threads.svg" width="22" height="22" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /> Threads <ArrowUpRight size={16} /><span class="sr-only"> (abre en una pestaña nueva)</span></a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.contact-page { padding: 5rem 1.5rem 7rem; color: #0f172a; background: linear-gradient(160deg, #e8f4ff 0%, #f8fbff 45%, #e7f5f0 100%); }
	.contact-page-inner { width: min(100%, 80rem); margin-inline: auto; }
	.contact-eyebrow, .contact-card-label { margin: 0; color: #047857; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.contact-intro { max-width: 54rem; margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.7; }
	.contact-admissions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 4rem; padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem); border-radius: 2rem; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(115deg, #10243d, #17458a 70%, #0c7a78); box-shadow: 0 25px 55px rgb(19 53 99 / 20%); }
	.contact-admissions-icon { display: grid; width: 4rem; height: 4rem; place-items: center; border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 30%); border-radius: 1.1rem; color: #a7f3d0; background: rgb(255 255 255 / 9%); }
	.contact-admissions .contact-card-label { color: #a7f3d0; }
	.contact-admissions h2 { margin: .65rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; }
	.contact-admissions-copy > p:not(.contact-card-label) { margin: .8rem 0 0; color: #dbeafe; line-height: 1.6; }
	.contact-email { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.1rem; color: #fff; font-weight: 650; overflow-wrap: anywhere; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #86efac; text-underline-offset: .3rem; }
	.contact-form-link { display: inline-flex; gap: .6rem; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 3.2rem; padding: .8rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 999px; color: #10243d; background: #fff; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease; }
	.contact-form-link:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #d1fae5; }
	.contact-details { margin-top: 6rem; padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); border-radius: 2.5rem; color: #fff; background: #10243d; box-shadow: 0 28px 65px rgb(16 36 61 / 16%); }
	.contact-details-heading h2, .contact-social h2 { margin: 1rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
	.contact-details-heading { position: relative; }
	.contact-details-heading .contact-eyebrow { color: #6ee7b7; }
	.contact-details-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 40rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; color: #b8cbdd; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.6; }
	.contact-card-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 28rem), 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
	.contact-info-card { position: relative; display: flex; min-width: 0; min-height: 15.5rem; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #d6e6f7; border-radius: 1.6rem; background: #fff; color: #10243d; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgb(0 0 0 / 10%); transition: transform .32s ease, border-color .32s ease, box-shadow .32s ease; }
	.contact-info-card::before { position: absolute; inset: 0 auto 0 0; width: 5px; background: linear-gradient(#2563eb, #38d9a9); content: ''; transform: scaleY(0); transform-origin: bottom; transition: transform .32s ease; }
	.contact-info-card:hover, .contact-info-card:focus-visible { transform: translateY(-6px); border-color: #8abced; box-shadow: 0 24px 42px rgb(0 0 0 / 20%); }
	.contact-info-card:hover::before, .contact-info-card:focus-visible::before { transform: scaleY(1); }
	.contact-info-card:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #6ee7b7; outline-offset: 4px; }
	.contact-info-icon { display: grid; width: 3.25rem; height: 3.25rem; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-radius: 1rem; background: #e3efff; color: #1d4ed8; transition: transform .32s ease; }
	.contact-info-whatsapp .contact-info-icon { background: #def8ec; }
	.contact-info-card:hover .contact-info-icon { transform: scale(1.08) rotate(-4deg); }
	.contact-info-label { color: #047857; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.contact-info-card strong { margin-top: .4rem; font-size: 1.25rem; }
	.contact-info-value { margin-top: .6rem; color: #475569; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.45; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	.contact-info-arrow { position: absolute; right: 1.5rem; bottom: 1.5rem; color: #2563eb; transition: transform .32s ease; }
	.contact-info-whatsapp .contact-info-arrow { color: #059669; }
	.contact-info-card:hover .contact-info-arrow { transform: translate(4px, -4px); }
	.contact-social { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 6rem; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #bfcee1; }
	.contact-social h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.7rem); }
	.contact-social-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; }
	.contact-social-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; min-height: 3.2rem; padding: .8rem 1.15rem; border: 1px solid #bfd2e8; border-radius: 999px; color: #17345f; background: #fff; font-weight: 700; transition: background .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
	.contact-social-links a:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #dbeafe; }
	@media (max-width: 1100px) { .contact-details-heading > p:last-child { max-width: none; } }
	@media (max-width: 900px) { .contact-admissions { grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); } .contact-form-link { grid-column: 2; justify-self: start; } }
	@media (max-width: 650px) { .contact-page { padding-top: 4rem; } .contact-admissions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .contact-form-link { grid-column: 1; } .contact-details { padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 1.75rem; } .contact-card-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .contact-info-card { min-height: 13.5rem; } .contact-social { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; } }
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .contact-form-link, .contact-social-links a, .contact-info-card, .contact-info-card::before, .contact-info-icon, .contact-info-arrow { transition: none; } .contact-info-card:hover, .contact-info-card:focus-visible { transform: none; } }
</style>
